# Standalone chat addressing

- `$threadId.tsx`: revisit the standalone-chat product model and browser address
  separately from project URL cleanup. Keep `/chat/<uuid>` unchanged for now;
  do not delete this route or require project slugs during that cleanup. If
  standalone chats remain, evaluate an account-scoped short opaque public ID
  while retaining the stable internal thread UUID. Identifier length, collision
  handling, and lookup authorization remain undecided.
